ouple minutes in a close  game  we would have the advantage because they  had pretty much annihilated everybody  everyone wonders how duke will handle  this game psychologically after that  contest a year ago  i can still remember you guys going on  the court  you guys were stone cold killers and you  guys  believed you believed augment has it  taken away  he finishes leitner called for it he got  it beautiful feed  mike shuszewski he has his guys  believing they can play this unlv  team i think from the start we let them  know that  this wasn't last year and uh there was a  moment in the second half  that it felt like they had maybe a  five-point lead  and we're kind of pulling away a little  bit and bobby  raised up still plenty of time  maybe the biggest shot that a player hit  during my time here at duke was bobby's  three what a big three by bobby  and you could see in their face it was  like in a  big time fight we landed a huge punch  [Applause]  and now we were in that the crucible of  two minutes  that we had talked about that pressure  can duke pull off one of the biggest  upsets in the final four  angles has done it  duke has upset unlv  everyone's going crazy in the hoosier  dome there's a celebration and you're  you're trying to keep us all  like composed like there's one more game  we just won  as big a game as duke has ever won  now we were going to be tested in it and  you guys  really passed the  [Applause]  has test its first national championship  obviously we win the game against kansas  what was that like  you know you don't think about legacy or  anything like that  it was more we did it we did it now  you know my thing can we ever do it  again and  we kept that team together and won it  again the following year  all right coach well hey i appreciate  this it was our first national  championship  in my first hologram so  good stuff coach well thank you so much  i appreciate you thank you  that was awesome  you

